# Violin Sheet Helper (Option 1: FastAPI + simple frontend)

Upload a violin sheet image/PDF, run OCR + note parsing, then return beginner-friendly guidance (string + finger).

## Project layout
- `src/api/` — HTTP endpoints
- `src/services/` — OCR / parsing / fingering logic
- `tests/` — unit + integration tests
- `docs/` — notes on the data contract and assumptions
- `artifacts/` — intermediate and final outputs

## Next steps
1. Implement `POST /upload` to accept files.
2. Implement `POST /analyze` (or integrate into upload) to produce guidance.
3. Build a minimal frontend to upload a file and display results.
